<title>UK: Racal Electronics buys U.S  firm Pelagos.</title>
<headline>Racal Electronics buys U.S  firm Pelagos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Racal Electronics Plc said on Tuesday it had bought U.S.-based survey company Pelagos Corp for 2.5 million dollars in cash.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the purchase would enhance Racal's access to the U.S. domestic, defence and telecommunications surveying markets.</p>
<p>In the year just ended Pelagos expects sales of around six million dollars with operating profits of 500,000.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
